      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clovis%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Clovis is home to 2026 Winter Olympics figure skating champion Alysa Liu, who grew up and trained here.",
